Comment:
 The JSON databases are generated from the unmodified /etc/services,
 /etc/protocols, and /etc/ethertypes files from Debian netbase 6.5,
 with an additional ICMPv6 alias.
 Source: https://sources.debian.org/src/netbase/6.5/
